This distribution contains the NSX external sensor and accessory drivers. The
Ambiq-authored sources in `include/nsx/sensors/`, `src/`, and `zephyr/` are
licensed under the BSD-3-Clause License in LICENSE. The existing drivers were ported from AmbiqAI's
neuralSPOT drivers; the exact upstream files and revisions are recorded in
PROVENANCE.md.

